<title>USA: Standard Management names Pheffer CFO.</title>
<headline>Standard Management names Pheffer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Management Corp said Thursday it appointed Paul (Pete) Pheffer as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Pheffer replaces John Quinn, who resigned after being named Commissioner of the Indiana Department of Insurance, the company said.  </p>
<p>Pheffer has previously served as chief financial officer for both Jackson National and Kemper Life Insurance Companies.</p>
<p>Standard Management is an international financial services holding company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
